# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository for all text files, regardless of a
# contributor's local core.autocrlf. Same fix as PulseNest (2026-08-24) — see that repo's
# conversation_log.md for the full diagnosis (mixed CRLF/LF history inflates unrelated diffs
# to whole-file size).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Known binary formats in this repo — never line-ending-normalize or diff as text.
*.lnk binary
